  "referenceNumber": "RUS2211",
  "remarks": "\nMUSA JALIL (IMO 8846814) is involved in activity whose object or effect is to destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine or to obtain a benefit from or support the Government of Russia. Namely, MUSA JALIL is involved in carrying military goods from a third country to a place in Russia. \n",
